				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "Your First Poke Ball"
			x: 4.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			description: ["Berries here are ordinary crops. They want the right temperature and the right water, they draw nutrients out of your soil, and they rot if you leave them lying about.\n\nThe healing berries grow nearly anywhere. The stranger ones will make you travel."]
			icon: "tfg:cheri_berry_seeds"
